<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Post says 1995 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Post says 1995 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1995 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities  c.360     vs 257</p>
<p>    Group sales				  28,800  vs 28,400</p>
<p>    Group investment			   2,500   vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    320,000 vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German postal group is Deutsche Post AG. The company released the figures above on its Internet page but was due to release more data at 0900 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
